Files: rust/crates/okp-linux-gtk/icons/*
Copyright: 2022 Lucide Contributors
 2013-2022 Cole Bemis (the icons that originate in Feather)
License: ISC and MIT
Comment:
 The symbolic icons the Linux shell resolves for its own chrome are Lucide
 artwork, compiled into the binary as a GResource and therefore present in
 every installed binary. The files are renamed into an `okp-` namespace so a
 user's icon theme cannot shadow them, and each stroke is rendered as a filled
 outline so GTK's symbolic recolour reaches it; the shapes are upstream's.
 Source: https://github.com/lucide-icons/lucide

